     "content": "Search Engine Optimization is the practice of earning visibility in search engines so people find your business at the moment they need it. This 10-lesson seminar covers everything from technical foundations to AI search, taught the way a working SEO professional and digital marketing professor would teach it. We start with the most important question: how do search engines actually work?",
